<title>USA: Belmont says in merger talks with Cavalier.</title>
<headline>Belmont says in merger talks with Cavalier.</headline>
<dateline>BELMONT, Miss. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belmont Homes Inc said Monday it is discussing a possible merger with Cavalier Homes Inc.</p>
<p>Belmont said tentative terms under discussion call for each of its common shares owned to be exchanged for 0.80 common shares of Cavalier in a tax-free reorganization accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>Belmont said the boards of both companies have not yet met to approve the possible combination.</p>
<p>It said there can be no assurance an agreement will be executed, that the terms of any such agreement will be acceptable to all parties, or that the deal will be consummated.</p>
</text>
